<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian unemployment falls in May to 5.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian unemployment falls in May to 5.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's Labour office said on Wednesday that unemployment in May was down to 5.6 percent from 5.9 percent in April.</p>
<p>					  May 97	April 97    May 96</p>
<p>LITHUANIAN UNEMPLOYMENT</p>
<p> Percent unemployed		  5.6	   5.9	   7.4</p>
<p> Number unemployed		   98,980	104,174     129,507</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 517</p>
</text>
